WEBVTT

00:01.557 --> 00:02.987
<b>Someone, help!</b>

00:05.967 --> 00:09.497
<b>Help! Help me!</b>

00:14.707 --> 00:18.217
<b>Th-They're going to kill me!</b>

00:19.527 --> 00:20.837
<b>Are you an adventurer?</b>

00:20.837 --> 00:23.277
<b>P-Please help me!</b>

00:35.627 --> 00:36.677
<b>Let me handle this.</b>

00:36.677 --> 00:38.297
<b>What?</b>

00:40.237 --> 00:42.737
<b>Can you really take them?</b>

00:42.737 --> 00:46.987
<b>Are you actually a famous 
adventurer despite how you look?</b>

00:48.227 --> 00:49.007
<b>No.</b>

00:49.767 --> 00:50.597
<b>What?!</b>

00:52.837 --> 00:56.837
<b>I just leveled up 
for the first time in my life.</b>

00:56.837 --> 00:59.837
<b>Y-You're hopeless!</b>

00:59.837 --> 01:03.107
<b>You're way weaker than me!</b>

01:03.107 --> 01:06.717
<b>A newbie can't handle that many monsters.</b>

01:06.717 --> 01:08.967
<b>And take off that heavy armor!</b>

01:09.797 --> 01:11.757
<b>We have to run!</b>

01:13.207 --> 01:15.557
<b><i>Rampart Reflection isn't perfect.</i></b>

01:16.447 --> 01:21.087
<b><i>Unless you negate all damage 
with a defense vastly superior</i></b>

01:21.877 --> 01:26.057
<b><i>to your opponent's attack, 
it doesn't activate.</i></b>

01:29.267 --> 01:30.537
<b>Run!</b>

01:37.847 --> 01:40.667
<b><i>It's ineffective against superior 
and unknown enemies.</i></b>

01:41.427 --> 01:42.307
<b><i>But...</i></b>

01:43.547 --> 01:45.287
<b>Rampart Reflection!</b>

01:53.627 --> 01:55.087
<b>What?!</b>

01:57.327 --> 01:58.437
<b>Defense</b>

01:58.437 --> 02:01.127
<b><i>I'm already familiar with starter enemies.</i></b>

02:01.437 --> 02:05.697
<b><i>And I boosted my defense with 
skill tree bonuses and equipment.</i></b>

02:07.447 --> 02:09.227
<b><i>When it comes to fighting Raana...</i></b>

02:09.227 --> 02:10.597
<b><i>I can beat dozens of them!</i></b>

02:14.557 --> 02:17.957
<b>What?!</b>

02:25.017 --> 02:29.467
<b>You beat that many Raana? Wh-Who are you?</b>

02:31.867 --> 02:34.267
<b>I'm Elymas Edvau...</b>

02:34.267 --> 02:36.787
<b>This is exactly what you deserve!</b>

02:36.787 --> 02:38.747
<b>Don't show your face here again!</b>

02:38.747 --> 02:41.347
<b>Don't use the Edvaughn family name 
outside these walls.</b>

02:41.347 --> 02:45.277
<b>If you do, I'll have your head!</b>

02:45.277 --> 02:47.197
<b>Sorry.</b>

02:51.617 --> 02:52.647
<b>No...</b>

02:56.647 --> 02:59.097
<b>I'm Elymas the Heavy Knight.</b>

