06:08.517 --> 06:12.027
<b>Heavy Knight? What's the meaning of this?!</b>

06:12.027 --> 06:16.937
<b>With low stats across the board 
and no decent attack skills, it's useless!</b>

06:16.937 --> 06:20.197
<b>Without a doubt, it's a defective class!</b>

06:22.837 --> 06:24.857
<b>Father, please calm down.</b>

06:24.857 --> 06:26.867
<b>It has the highest HP and defense.</b>

06:26.867 --> 06:29.777
<b>I don't care about that!</b>

06:31.157 --> 06:33.717
<b>But I think you're amazing.</b>

06:34.317 --> 06:36.837
<b>I think we'd be great together.</b>

06:37.197 --> 06:40.267
<b>I promise I'll change 
the others' minds, too.</b>

06:41.347 --> 06:43.877
<b>Nah, I'm good.</b>

06:43.877 --> 06:45.777
<b>What? But why?</b>

06:45.777 --> 06:48.627
<b>That was a shield class 
fighting style, right?</b>

06:48.627 --> 06:51.937
<b>You'll never level up if you go it alone.</b>

06:52.327 --> 06:54.567
<b>Don't be stubborn.</b>

07:03.547 --> 07:04.597
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:06.917 --> 07:08.917
<b><i>Arus is right.</i></b>

07:10.037 --> 07:14.347
<b><i>Normally, defensive classes are best 
when they're drawing enemy attacks</i></b>

07:14.347 --> 07:16.987
<b><i>and protecting allies.</i></b>

07:17.867 --> 07:22.527
<b><i>But if I drag along a bunch of allies, 
I'll have to share EXP.</i></b>

07:22.527 --> 07:25.347
