19:40.067 --> 19:42.377
<b>Yeah, I farmed them alone.</b>

19:42.907 --> 19:44.777
<b>Put that in your report.</b>

19:44.777 --> 19:46.667
<b>Huh? Um, okay.</b>

19:47.347 --> 19:48.927
<b>He's not lying, right?</b>

19:49.337 --> 19:51.467
<b>What's up with that Heavy Knight?</b>

19:51.467 --> 19:53.767
<b>He must be cheating.</b>

19:57.467 --> 20:01.487
<b><i>I've finished registering, and I've got 
funds to cover living expenses.</i></b>

20:02.577 --> 20:07.097
<b><i>What comes next gets my 
</i>Magic World<i> player blood pumping!</i></b>

20:08.057 --> 20:11.027
<b>Are there any promotion quests I can take?</b>

20:11.027 --> 20:12.207
<b>What?!</b>

20:13.767 --> 20:17.287
<b>I mean, technically, yes...</b>

20:47.797 --> 20:54.337
<b>I heard a clown 
had joined this Raid Quest.</b>

20:54.987 --> 20:57.097
<b>It must be you, Elymas.</b>

20:58.027 --> 21:03.627
<b>There are plenty of newbies like you 
who underestimate guilds and monsters.</b>

21:04.107 --> 21:07.697
<b>You beat an Ariandype at level 12?</b>

21:07.697 --> 21:09.507
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

21:09.837 --> 21:12.137
<b>Adventuring isn't that easy!</b>

21:12.137 --> 21:15.637
<b>I'll teach you a lesson!</b>

21:32.757 --> 21:34.407
<b><i>Well, this sucks.</i></b>

21:56.007 --> 21:59.507
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:12.757 --> 23:16.717
<b><i>I joined a Raid Quest 
to raise my adventurer rank.</i></b>

23:17.157 --> 23:20.047
<b><i>Ranks are tied to advancement caps.</i></b>

23:21.317 --> 23:24.597
<b><i>But I've got a bad feeling 
about this Raid Quest.</i></b>

23:24.957 --> 23:28.057
<b><i>The arrogance of experienced 
adventurers. Cowering newbies.</i></b>

23:28.497 --> 23:30.717
<b><i>I hope nothing happens.</i></b>

23:30.717 --> 23:32.777
<b><i>Next time, "The Raid Quest."</i></b>

23:33.337 --> 23:37.237
<b><i>If we back each other up, 
we have nothing to fear.</i></b>
